# slug: ch67-publish
# source: chapters/ch67.tex:58
# label: alg:ch67-publish
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch67.tex:61
# caption: Publish a completed version through one serialized owner.

REQUIRE validated artifact A with request epoch e, current epoch r
ENSURE stale results never replace the current entry
enter the owner operation
IF e != r THEN
  discard the unpublished artifact; RETURN stale
END IF
fully initialize entry metadata and recovery dependencies for A
mark the previous entry retired
install A as the current entry
RETURN published

